  abilityDesc: 35 combo massive Water attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining
    HP), damage taken hugely boosts BB gauge and enormously restores HP for 4 turns,
    adds probable resistance against 1 KO attack, raises allies from KO & enormously
    boosts max HP
